ui/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── WorkRally MCP App 的 IDE 桥接元数据（每台机器自动生成，不入库）──
.cursor/skills/workrally-mcp-app/
.cursor/rules/workrally-mcp-app.mdc
.cursor/rules/workrally-mcp-app-*.mdc
.codebuddy/skills/workrally-mcp-app/
